      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "As Past-President, [Dr. Mayo] accompanied Dr. Martin on an official trip to Panama, Peru, Chile, Argentina, and Uruguay in 1920, where they met with presidents as well as leading surgeons and health officials. A number of prominent South American surgeons received Fellowship in the College, establishing a connection that endures to this day."},
